+# [MP8] ===== 8-player rework parameters (finalized by the user 2026-08-14, see HANDOFF T6) =====
+#
+# Players → duck:hunter    ≤4 → 3:1 | 5 → 4:1 | 6 → 4:2 | 7 → 5:2 | 8 → 6:2
