+const MP8_HUNTER_SIDE_OFFSET: float = 2.0
+
+# Duck spawn points are spread evenly only within the span of vanilla's 3 points and **don't extend outward** (extending goes off the map, tested by the user).
+# ⚠️ The generic fill-in algorithm (midpoint of two neighboring points) can't be used either. With 3 points it produces **overlapping** spawn points —
